<sheets>
<sheet>
<plain>
<text x="320.04" y="226.06" size="1.778" layer="91">This sheet is the 'high voltage' side. It shows the
common HV rail and 100K bias resistors to the
individual SiPM, and the 10N capacitor to one 
side of the downstream signal processing.
These are the SxxK signals.</text>
</plain>
