<sheet>
<plain>
<text x="289.56" y="91.44" size="1.778" layer="91">This is the lower side of the SiPM bias. The DxxA signals
is connected directly to the SiPM anodes. The signal
readout is via capacitors to signals SxxA. The bias is
via the 100K resistors and 10K to GND, with the individual
DAC providing their voltage to points TRxx.</text>
</plain>
